== Behavior ==
A '''Cretan Bull''' rams towards the player at high speeds, dealing {{Stat|Damage|1k/2k/3k/4k/6k/10k}} (based on the tier) and {{stat|true knockback}} upon hitting them. After a successful hit, the '''Cretan Bull''' stops moving for {{Green|5}} seconds before ramming again, although it will still inflict damage on contact.

